  "contentHtml": "<p>선생님 글 보고 힘을 얻어&#160;</p><p>과학동아리 학생들 마무리 활동으로&#160;</p><p>자신만의 원소기호 티셔츠 만들기에 도전했습니다.&#160;</p><p>일주일동안 디자인 하고 수정보완했더니</p><p>각자 멋짐 작품을 만들어 냈습니다.</p><p>새학기에는 과학동아리 시작하는 활동을 해서&#160;</p><p>단체 티셔츠를 만들면 좋겠다며 함께 디자인에 대해서도 이야기 나눌 수 있었어요.&#160;</p><p>덕분에 학생들과 즐겁고 뿌듯하게 마무리 했습니다. ^^<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/48b5589fafc5e9746fea0094e79335b0ab360596\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/48b5589fafc5e9746fea0094e79335b0ab360596\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f66a3191c8f0186c756879a1ee6e17db2afa7902\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f66a3191c8f0186c756879a1ee6e17db2afa7902\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/225294ff60b272d3a5a412828eab1faf2bd8d40f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/225294ff60b272d3a5a412828eab1faf2bd8d40f\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f58644445bd0511acc84be4f65cbb5394ffe08d9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f58644445bd0511acc84be4f65cbb5394ffe08d9\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumc